"188197274", "author": {"steamid": "76561199552506101", "personaname": "Poncho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199552506101/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 516, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 516, "last_played": 1740281460, "avatar": "1b0a867c0531dddd3675a2ecc8017345069142a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "While not quite as refined as the sequel, it's still a great time.\n\nPros:\n- The pixel art is great.\n\n- The soundtrack is fantastic.\n\n- Many satisfying weapons, abilities and items.\n\n- Very replayable.\n\nCons:\n- The first few minutes of every run are very tedious and grindy. This mixed with the very limited traversal make it feel like a chore at first.\n\n- The very small sprites mixed with the chaos on screen make it difficult to parse what it s going on.", "timestamp_created": 1739894106, "timestamp_updated": 1740414680, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188172651", "author": {"steamid": "76561198283982971", "personaname": "squegeemcgee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198283982971/", "num_games_owned": 151, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 1850, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1850, "last_played": 1707060842, "avatar": "2e311e5df7efa3e80c56b6658d8914ec148e5ccf"}, "language": "english", "review": "get punished for not going fast. cmon man, I wanna be thorough\n", "timestamp_created": 1739860265, "timestamp_updated": 1739860265, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480557560920715332", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_fr